# scripts/opcount: `irforms bench segpath N` builds N paths of std's ui.Seg
# (dash-gui's chart stroke: 8 MoveTo and 8 LineTo appended to a path with
# room for them) and reads each segment; the cost of one path is the slope
# between the two sizes (FLAT-STD). The control is hand Go with a segment
# struct of an op and a point, which is also the floor: a path needs its
# 16 segments written once and read once.
unit path
sizes 20000 220000
args bench segpath {n}
control benchmarks/forms/testdata/control
